    <!--
      TrustShield launcher mark: shield silhouette + "T" (#139).

      The blue field comes from `@color/launcher_background` (#2F6BFF), so the shield is drawn white
      and the T is drawn in the brand blue. Geometry budget: an adaptive-icon mask may crop to the
      centre 72x72 of this 108x108 viewport, and only the centre 66-dp circle (r = 33 about 54,54) is
      guaranteed visible. Every point below stays within r <= 29.7 of the centre, so no launcher mask
      (squircle, circle, teardrop, square) can clip the shield or the T. The previous artwork spanned
      x 20..88 / y 8..101 (r up to 47.4) and lost its shoulders and tip to the mask.
    -->
